Third-party data in this directory
==================================

The JSON files here are generated by scripts/apk-extract.mjs and
scripts/build-spec.mjs. Do not hand edit them.

Tasker
------
Action names, parameter labels, help text and event/state names in
action-names.json, arg-labels.json, help.json, event-names.json,
state-names.json, res-ids.json, unmatched-an-names.json and the `resName`,
`label` and `help` fields of actions.json are string resources extracted from
the Tasker Android app (net.dinglisch.android.taskerm) by Joao Dias
(joaoapps), https://tasker.joaoapps.com. Tasker and its strings remain the
property of their author; they are reproduced here only to describe Tasker's
action set for interoperability.

